    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、大体は終わったよ\r\nしかし咲耶は……こんなところで休憩か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まあ、そんなところさ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……咲耶のことだから、今頃色んな人たちと話して\r\n仲良くなっていると思ってたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。さっきまでは、そうしていたよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、こうやって一歩引いた場所から、\r\n楽しそうにする人たちを眺めるのも良いものなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、意外そうな顔をしているね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "確かに、私は人と語らうひとときを何よりも愛している\r\nけれど、私が今こうしてひとりでいたとしても――",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
