    "se": "0495",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あの輪へ一歩踏み出せば、\r\nみな温かい笑顔で私を受け入れてくれる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう思うと、一緒に話すのとはまた違う\r\n嬉しい気持ちになれるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
