    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、これは私だけのひとり遊びとも言えるね",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、咲耶らしい考え方だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど、せっかくアナタが来てくれたからね\r\n一緒に、あの輪の中へ入ろうじゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタと一緒なら、\r\nまた違う楽しみ方ができそうだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。じゃあ、行こうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、その花束は俺が預かっておくよ\r\n持ったままだと動きづらいだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうだね\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、その前に……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020130"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
