    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ちょっと、失礼するよ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、咲耶？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "動かないで……そう、もう少しだけ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "――よし、できた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん、思ったとおりだ\r\nアナタのスーツには、この花がよく映える",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、薔薇のブートニエール……\r\nとても似合っているよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020180"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "white1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "ffffff"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeOutQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500,
    "stillCtrl": "off"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうかな……\r\nちょっとキザじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "より良い自分を演出することを、\r\nキザなんて言葉で片づけてしまうのはつまらないことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタがより素敵になったら、\r\n私はとても嬉しく思うのだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言われたら、\r\n何も反論できなくなるな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス、しなくていいんだよ\r\n私に言った言葉、忘れたとは言わせないよ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは私の悩みも、不安も、\r\nまるで淡雪かのように容易く溶かしてしまった",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの言葉のおかげで\r\n私は今、このドレスを纏っているんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ほら、見てごらん。この花は、まるでアナタのために\r\n用意されていたと思うほどだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "花もアナタの傍にいられて、\r\n嬉しそうに微笑んでいるようじゃないか",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、褒めすぎじゃないか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。私は本心しか口にしないよ\r\nそれは、アナタも知っているだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから……\r\nそんな誇るべきアナタを、みんなにもっと知ってほしいな",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007020290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ほら、行こうか。私の、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600702/2006007020290"
  },
